  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Advancing Access to Comprehensive Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights of Adolescent Girls and Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective: To improve access to Comprehensive Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights of adolescent girls and women in selected local government areas of three states of Nigeria (Akwa Ibom, Gombe and Kaduna).  

Outcome: By 2025 women and adolescent girls in selected Local Government Areas in three states exercise their Sexual Reproductive Health and Rights and have improved access to integrated Sexual and Reproductive health services, including i) Family Planning; ii) EmONC; iii) Obstetric Fistula Care and iv) Gender Based Violence Services.</narrative>
  </description>
